<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>{{ title }}</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
           color: #222; max-width: 900px; margin: 32px auto; padding: 0 16px; line-height: 1.5; }
    h1 { color: #1f4e79; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    h2 { color: #1f4e79; border-bottom: 2px solid #e3eaf2; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 32px; }
    h3 { color: #555; margin-top: 24px; }
    .meta { color: #888; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .commentary { background: #f5f8fb; border-left: 4px solid #1f4e79;
                  padding: 12px 16px; margin: 12px 0; }
    .commentary ul { margin: 4px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
    table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 12px 0; font-size: 14px; }
    th, td { padding: 8px 10px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #e3eaf2; }
    th { background: #f0f4f8; }
    td.num { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .pos { color: #2e7d32; }
    .neg { color: #c62828; }
    img.chart { display: block; margin: 12px 0; max-width: 100%; }
    .disclaimer { background: #fff8e1; border: 1px solid #f0d27a; padding: 12px 16px;
                  font-size: 12px; color: #6b5300; margin-top: 32px; border-radius: 4px; }
    .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 10px;
             background: #e3eaf2; color: #1f4e79; font-size: 11px; margin-right: 4px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
  <div class="meta">Generated {{ generated_at }} · Lookback {{ lookback_days }} days · {{ fund_count }} funds tracked</div>

  {% block content %}{% endblock %}

  <div class="disclaimer">
    <strong>Disclaimer.</strong> This report contains market observations and
    quantitative signals derived from publicly available data. It is not, and
    should not be construed as, personalised investment advice or an offer to
    buy or sell any security. Past performance does not guarantee future
    results. All recommendations to clients must be reviewed and signed off by
    a licensed adviser in accordance with local regulations.
  </div>
</body>
</html>
